```bscript
let arr := [1, 2, 3, 4, 5];
println(arr[0]);     // index access
println(arr[2]);
```

Iterate with a for loop:

```bscript
let values := [10, 20, 30];
for (let i := 0; i < 3; i := i + 1) {
    println(values[i]);
}
```

