## Variables

Declare with `let`, assign with `:=`. No `=` alone.

```bscript
let x := 42;
let name := "Alice";
let flag := true;
let pi := 3.14;
```

Reassign (no `let` needed for an existing variable):

```bscript
x := x + 1;
name := "Bob";
```

Delayed initialisation with `null`:

```bscript
let result := null;
result := some_function();
```

